      "message": "I would disagree that idea2 would be complex. Looking at the current state of the scripts. Almost all the script requires some very common clean up like the following\n\n1- Replacing `../../`\u0027 then doing a location tag. [I think this will apply to every script.\n2- Replacing the value of [-o, --output] with `$(out)`.\n3- Replacing `^gen` with `$(genDir)`\n\n\nIf we are going all the way doing the OO path. I\u0027d most likely say that we can have a ActionArgsSanitizer factory that would instantiate the class depending on the script you\u0027ve given. If no script has been found that match then you get the BaseActionSanitizer.",
